    "DefaultText": "Tinned Storage Pot"
  },
  "CardDescription": {
    "ParentObjectID": "advanced_copper_tools_tinned_pot",
    "LocalizationKey": "Advanced_Copper_Tools_TinnedPot_CardDescription",
    "DefaultText": "A clay storage pot lined with a thin coat of tin and fitted with a tin lid. Food spoils more slowly in it than in a plain clay pot. The tin wears away over about a season, then the pot turns back into a plain clay pot and keeps its contents."
  },
