    "ParentObjectID": "advanced_copper_tools_tinned_pot",
    "LocalizationKey": "Advanced_Copper_Tools_TinnedPot_CardHelpSection",
    "DefaultText": "<b>Spoilage:</b> Slows to 50% of normal rate (a plain clay pot is 70%, a sealed one 40%).\n\n<b>Tin lining:</b> Wears away over about one season, whether the pot is carried or placed. When it is gone the pot turns into a plain clay pot and everything inside stays inside."
  },
